OL,3,GNEWSASchool hack takes 'huge mental
OL,4,Atoll' on teachers
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeachers employed by a city council say
OL,7,Fthey are facing prolonged working hours
OL,8,Fand burnout after a hack which saw
OL,9,F320,000 stolen files published on the
OL,10,Fdark web.
OL,12,FBristol City Council was forced to shut
OL,13,Fdown its IT server for schools after a
OL,14,Fcyber attack in September - leaving 39
OL,15,Fschools without access to key planning
OL,16,Fand lesson resources.
OL,18,FOne teacher said the extra workload had
OL,19,Ftaken a "huge" mental toll and the
OL,20,FNational Education Union (NEU) called
OL,21,Ffor measures to safeguard staff against
OL,22,Fburnout.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
