OL,3,GNEWSASchool hack takes 'huge mental
OL,4,Atoll' on teachers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council's lead for children
OL,7,Facknowledged the risks staff were
OL,8,Ffacing but said the authority could not
OL,9,Fgive a time-frame for a solution until
OL,10,Fthe police investigation into the hack
OL,11,Fwas finished.
